{"id":"ab8391d7623da45d","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical.md","title":"GL Arithmetical Soundness","display":"thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical — GL Arithmetical Soundness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical","aliases":["89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical"],"display":"thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical — GL Arithmetical Soundness","depends_on":["[[89-thm-lob-internal]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]","[[89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical — GL Arithmetical Soundness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a1c8bb923975db7e\" href=\"?note=a1c8bb923975db7e\" title=\"89-thm-lob-internal\">89-thm-lob-internal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1f581262c09d5e34\" href=\"?note=1f581262c09d5e34\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-arithmetical-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"86ad48bbd1843ed6\" href=\"?note=86ad48bbd1843ed6\" title=\"89-df-peano-arithmetic\">89-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8f382173effd5662\" href=\"?note=8f382173effd5662\" title=\"89-df-pa-provable-formula\">89-df-pa-provable-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"453434df21a27b52\" href=\"?note=453434df21a27b52\" title=\"89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions\">89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> is the set of PA arithmetical realizations.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> is the PA-provable-sentence set.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}arithmetical}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\;\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}arithmetical}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\;\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 3 章，印刷页 51–62；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n对 GL 有限证明归纳。命题重言式的翻译在经典 PA 中可证；K 由第二派生条件验证；Löb 模式由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a1c8bb923975db7e\" href=\"?note=a1c8bb923975db7e\" title=\"89-thm-lob-internal\">89-thm-lob-internal</a> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T=\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 时的对象语言定理验证；MP 保可证性；必然化由第一派生条件验证。PA 的三条件见独立原子 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"453434df21a27b52\" href=\"?note=453434df21a27b52\" title=\"89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions\">89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions</a>。此方向不要求 PA 在自身内部证明一致性，也不使用外部反模型构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-thm-lob-internal","status":"resolved","id":"a1c8bb923975db7e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-lob-internal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-realization","status":"resolved","id":"1f581262c09d5e34","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-pa-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8f382173effd5662","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"453434df21a27b52","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-lob-internal","status":"resolved","id":"a1c8bb923975db7e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 3 章，印刷页 51–62；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n对 GL 有限证明归纳。命题重言式的翻译在经典 PA 中可证；K 由第二派生条件验证；Löb 模式由 [[89-thm-lob-internal]] 在 $T=\\mathrm{PA}$ 时的对象语言定理验证；MP 保可证性；必然化由第一派生条件验证。PA 的三条件见独立原子 [[89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions]]。此方向不要求 PA 在自身内部证明一致性，也不使用外部反模型构造。","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"453434df21a27b52","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 3 章，印刷页 51–62；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n对 GL 有限证明归纳。命题重言式的翻译在经典 PA 中可证；K 由第二派生条件验证；Löb 模式由 [[89-thm-lob-internal]] 在 $T=\\mathrm{PA}$ 时的对象语言定理验证；MP 保可证性；必然化由第一派生条件验证。PA 的三条件见独立原子 [[89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions]]。此方向不要求 PA 在自身内部证明一致性，也不使用外部反模型构造。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}arithmetical}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\;\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.","display":true},{"tex":"T=\\mathrm{PA}","display":false}],"bytes":1556,"backlinks":[{"id":"89cc8db92b5fad14","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"GL定理在每个 PA 算术实现下都可证；这是\n[[89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical]] 的直接重述。"},{"id":"0517fc365e0749bc","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ce4fe6d93660be43","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"02523cf5c9863d04","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"来源：Boolos 第 3 章 pp.51–62。将 [[89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical]] 中的全称实现 $\\tau$ 实例化为给定 $\\tau_\\sigma$，直接得到 Assertion；这里只使用标准 PA 实现，不需要 Solovay 极限句的特殊性质。"},{"id":"be68cce492414c6b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-463","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical]]"}],"outgoing":["a1c8bb923975db7e","0006800fa1c85177","1f581262c09d5e34","86ad48bbd1843ed6","8f382173effd5662","453434df21a27b52"]}